Merge audit
-----------
`git diff origin/main..HEAD --stat` contains only adblock files plus the reader
fixes. Main-touched files (`app/AndroidManifest.xml`, `app/assets/extract.js`,
`AudioDsp.kt`, `DiagLog.kt`, `PcmPlayer.kt`, `PlaybackService.kt`,
`SentenceSplitter.kt`, `SherpaEngine.kt`, `WebExtractor.kt`) have an empty diff
against `origin/main`. The rebase is linear and has no conflict markers.

Reference APKs (REA, JADX 1.5.6)
---------------------------------
HayaiTTS 2.5.1  dev.ahmedmohamed.hayaitts  43ff2cf33b4b7da64182f90f7787c9b691db0e35d5ef66393204ed93a3a71a07
NekoSpeak 1.4.2 com.nekospeak.tts          fabd52784a110e2abc751ead7b4b96249839cd01418cfacd07226ba2d861d428

- HayaiTTS 2.5.1 calls blocking generate(text, sid, speed); streamPcm only
  re-chunks a completed float[] (no progressive callback), max 2,000 chars.
- NekoSpeak 1.4.2 split regex `(?<=[.!?])\s+|\n+|(?<=[;])\s+`; only the first
  sentence is re-split at >75 chars (comma/60); later batches 148/398 tokens;
  one callback per batch.
- No GPL code copied. NekoSpeak (MIT) was used as prior-art evidence only.
